window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Enchantress witch Elle is back with an epic magical adventure as she and the witch detectives, plus Elle's witch mom, two henchwomen witches, and their new witch client, head from the proverbial cauldron into the fire when a goblin handfasting becomes a quest to protect a girl from her dangerous birthright at the hands of would-be usurpers to the goblin kingdom. <br><br>As well, their client, Skye, has a little wyvern dragon problem--it's invisible, it's stuck to her back, and it all started with a cursed harp. <br><br>Will a secret standing stone in a maze unlock their deepest, darkest secrets and help them to fight off paranormal enemies?<br><br>Herein this exciting tale be a werewolf, dragons, witches, goblins, shapeshifters, enchanters, and bumpy paths to old love, new love, and, as always, true love...<br><br>THE WITCH DETECTIVES is a compelling and darkly funny paranormal mystery series with fast-paced plots that twist and turn, witchy romance, and supernatural thrills.</p>"; 
